this plane of existence as a wrinkled old man with a stooped back.  Aside from
his glowing red eyes and the fact that he is levitating in mid-air, he appears
as any other old human male would.  Malebolge is one of the most powerful of
gods, representing death, decay, disease, and chaotic evil.  He is the patron
god of Assassins and the chaotic evil alignment.    
~
